  "description": "Hackday Dec is a 12-hour online AI hackathon by Team TrishulX. Build and ship a working project in one day. Format: 12-hour online hackathon on Saturday, 12 December 2026, 9:00 AM to 9:00 PM IST. Open to students and developers. Solo participants or teams of up to 4. Any tech stack, any theme - build anything. Process: Register on this Unstop page before 11 December 2026, 11:59 PM IST. Registration is free. Build and ship your working project during the 12-hour event on 12 December 2026, 9:00 AM to 9:00 PM IST. Judging by the Team TrishulX panel Rules: All code must be written fresh during the hackathon - pre-built projects are not allowed. Your submission must be your team's own work; plagiarism leads to disqualification. One team submits one project. The organisers' decision on winners is final. Top teams win Kero keyboards — Hive 75 for the winners, Hive 65 RGB for the runners-up.",
