    "details": "<p><strong>Hackday Dec is a 12-hour online AI hackathon by Team TrishulX. Build and ship a working project in one day.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Format:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>12-hour online hackathon on Saturday, 12 December 2026, 9:00 AM to 9:00 PM IST.</li>\n<li>Open to students and developers.</li>\n<li>Solo participants or teams of up to 4.</li>\n<li>Any tech stack, any theme - build anything.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Process:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Register on this Unstop page before 11 December 2026, 11:59 PM IST. Registration is free.</li>\n<li>Build and ship your working project during the 12-hour event on 12 December 2026, 9:00 AM to 9:00 PM IST.</li>\n<li>Judging by the Team TrishulX panel</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Rules:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>All code must be written fresh during the hackathon - pre-built projects are not allowed.</li>\n<li>Your submission must be your team's own work; plagiarism leads to disqualification.</li>\n<li>One team submits one project.</li>\n<li>The organisers' decision on winners is final.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Top teams win Kero keyboards &mdash; Hive 75 for the winners, Hive 65 RGB for the runners-up.</strong></p>",
